      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 36},
      "id": 15,
      "options": {
        "content": "# ScaryDB Control Panel\n\n**This dashboard provides real-time monitoring AND control capabilities.**\n\n## Manual Trigger Required\n- All control actions require manual confirmation\n- No auto-scaling or auto-recovery actions\n- Use the buttons below to trigger operations\n\n## Available Controls (via API/CLI)\n- **Backup**: `BACKUP /path/to/backup;` via client\n- **Restore**: `RESTORE /path/to/backup;` via client\n- **Circuit Breaker**: `CIRCUIT BREAKER RESET;` via client\n- **Config Changes**: `SET CONFIG <property> <value>;` via client\n- **Resource Limits**: Modify `config.json` and reload\n- **Auth Management**: `AUTH <key>` / `AUTH TOKEN <jwt>` via client\n\n## Quick Actions\n```bash\n# Connect to CLI\nscarydb client\n\n# Check status\nPING\nINFO\nSTATS\nSHOW RESOURCE USAGE\nSHOW RESOURCE LIMITS\n```\n\n---\n*Last updated: {{__from}} to {{__to}}*",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Control Panel Instructions",
      "type": "text"
